• Session history
• User context cache" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
