        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bouncer" value="Layer 1: Bouncer (ECS Fargate)
Rule gate (μs) → Haiku classifier (Bedrock)
200ms total budget · fail-open on timeout
Confidence &lt; 0.7 → escalate (Review Log)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530" y="510" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="classifier" value="Layer 2: Intent Classifier (ECS Fargate)
Fast path: Bedrock Titan embeddings (~20ms)
Deep path: Claude Sonnet (Bedrock) + MCP tools
Confidence &lt; 0.6 → graceful degradation ladder" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530" y="620" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="strategist" value="Layer 3: Routing Strategist (ECS Fargate)
≥0.85 deterministic · 0.5–0.85 Haiku arbitration · &lt;0.5 escalate
Policy engine (data residency, MAS, cross-jurisdiction)
Always-parallel vendor health check" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530" y="730" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="adapters" value="Layer 4: Vendor Adapters (ECS Fargate)
LiteLLM over Bedrock
Cross-region inference profiles (apac.*)
Streaming enabled · intent-aware timeouts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530" y="840" width="420" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bedrock" value="Amazon Bedrock
(ap-southeast-1)
• Haiku 4.5 (bouncer, arbitration)
• Sonnet 4.6 (classifier deep path, vendor)
