        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend
▢ green = pipeline layer (ECS Fargate)
▢ yellow = edge / network component
▢ orange = Presidio / MCP sidecar
▢ red/pink = Amazon Bedrock
▢ purple = data store
▢ dashed = supporting / async link
