• All LLM calls via Bedrock (IAM-locked region)
• JWT validated at edge
• Single redaction pass at orchestrator entry
• Bouncer fails open on timeout
• Correlation ID via ContextVar" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
